1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,838
Woman: Our annual cultural festival is just two months away.

2
00:00:04,838 --> 00:00:10,160
Have you had a chance to look at my layout design?

3
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:14,040
Man: Yeah, looks good. Just one question

4
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:17,060
Why did you move the location of the vendor booths?

5
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:20,140
They were along the south side of the field last year.

6
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:25,900
Woman: Remember, we alternate their positioning year to year to give the grass a chance to fully recover.

7
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:29,100
All that concentrated foot traffic does a lot of damage.

8
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:33,120
Man: Okay, and where are we up to with vendor registration

9
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,280
How many payments have we collected?

10
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:43,230
Woman: Actually, Javier is handling all the vendor business. He's around here somewhere.
